 "notes": "Xwejni Bay with the shore entry at the Washing Machine inlet in the salt pans and the Double Arch reef about 230 m due north of it: reef top 17 m, two stacked arches from about 20–27 m down to the sand at 36 m, the reef continuing to 45 m. Depths and route (surface swim, descent at the 14 m drop-off, boulders at 25 m, return over the posidonia) from gozodive.com, maltadives.com and divebluewaters.com; the arch and the Washing Machine positions are the OpenStreetMap dive-spot nodes, and the shoreline is from OpenStreetMap. Maltadives.com gives the arch about 300 m further north; the larger cave further out is not placed. Positions are approximate.",
